# ML features & horizons

- Build features in `build_feature_rows` (`traderbot/ml/features.py`) so each row at index `i` uses only bars `0..i`.
- Prefer explicit **recent path** signals: multi-bar returns, distance from rolling mean / bands, ATR regime — not only slow oscillators.
- Horizon labels use `forward_log_return`; respect `min_bars_for_forecast_eval` and embargo in `traderbot/ml/dataset.py`.
- Batch runs: `traderbot ml batch ... --all-horizons`; horizon slices under `data/crypto/horizons/`.
- When tuning per horizon, sanity-check against recent price regime; do not leak holdout prices into training labels.
